{
 "board_sha256": "2b1260ebd109fe7529cc3cd64c35c86f789a4dfc8caa5aeecd941aeaeb596911",
 "caveat": "EVERY net's ladder ended on the 0.020 mm rung marked `over_budget` (115.6 M cells > 80 M).  NOT ONE of these nets is proved impossible; each is refused down to 0.025 mm and BOUNDED there.  The `lattice` block per net is a RE-READ with the coherent binding_pad/required pairing this decision fixed, not the incoherent one the runs themselves recorded.",
 "cell_budget": 80000000,
 "findings": [
  "BTN_DOWN_N IS THE ONLY NET THAT ROUTES -- at ALL FIVE pitches, 41.610 to 49.307 mm -- and clause 8 refuses every one of them: PP3 STRANDED, `U3.12` alone on a 4.664 mm2 GND fragment with ZERO barrels.  The routing_ledger independently reports GND REGRESSED and the edge count flat at 51.  This is a POUR wall, not a routing wall, and it is the most actionable net on the board.",
  "REFINEMENT MOVES THE WALL, IT DOES NOT ONLY LOWER IT.  `I2S_LRCLK` refuses NO_LEGAL_ESCAPE_DST at 0.100 and 0.0667 mm and NO_PATH at 0.050 mm and below; `SPI_B_SCK` does the same across 0.0667 -> 0.050 mm.  A finer lattice DID unlock the pad escape, and the wall then became the corridor.  An escape refusal is NOT lattice-independent.",
  "AND D-620's MARGIN SCREEN IS NECESSARY-AND-NOT-SUFFICIENT IN THE ESCAPE DIRECTION TOO.  On both of those nets the lattice block read CLEAR and `too_coarse false` at the very pitch where the escape still failed.  The margin says a guard band FITS; it does not say the cells are FREE.",
  "`ACC_5V_LX` has a land with NO LATTICE AT ANY PITCH -- `U21.5`, best margin <= 0 -- and that land is exactly the NO_LEGAL_ESCAPE_DST destination the router refused on at all five rungs.  A ladder cannot answer it; a placement change, a land licence or `route_local_two_pad` can.",
  "`NFC_VDD_RF` refuses NO_LEGAL_ESCAPE_DST invariantly across 0.0667 -> 0.025 mm, consistent with D-621's isolation of its blocker to `NFC_RFO2`'s north chain: copper, not pitch.",
  "`ACC_5V_BOOST_EN`, `BTN_LEFT_N` and `SX1262_DIO1` are NO_PATH at every in-budget rung.  `ACC_5V_BOOST_EN`'s own `auto` is already 0.0333 mm, so it reaches the budget in TWO rungs."
 ],
